title = 移动分支 branch
cards = checkout commit-auto merge reset-hard

[description]

你的一位同事把这里弄乱了，把分支 branch 放到了错误的时间线上！

你可以删除并重新创建这些分支 branch，不过也可以直接把它们移动到不同的提交 commit：先对分支名使用

    git checkout

然后在你希望分支指向的提交 commit 上使用

    git reset --hard

即可。

donut 分支 branch 已经在正确位置，但时间线还不完整。请让你在那条分支里真的把甜甜圈吃掉！

[setup]

echo "You do not have a baguette.

You do not have coffee.

You do not have a donut." > you

git add .
git commit -m "The Beginning"

git checkout -b coffee
echo "You have a baguette.

You do not have coffee.

You do not have a donut." > you
git add .
git commit -m "You buy a baguette"

echo "You ate a baguette.

You do not have coffee.

You do not have a donut." > you
git add .
git commit -m "You eat the baguette"

git checkout -b baguette main
echo "You do not have a baguette.

You have coffee.

You do not have a donut." > you
git add .
git commit -m "You buy some coffee"

echo "You do not have a baguette.

You drank coffee.

You do not have a donut." > you
git add .
git commit -m "You drink the coffee"

git checkout -b donut main
echo "You do not have a baguette.

You do not have coffee.

You have a donut." > you
git add .
git commit -m "You buy a donut"

git checkout --detach main

[win]

# 你在 baguette 分支 branch 上吃掉法棍了吗？
git show baguette:you | grep "You ate.*baguette"

# 你在 coffee 分支 branch 上喝掉咖啡了吗？
git show coffee:you | grep "You drank.*coffee"

# 你在 donut 分支 branch 上吃掉甜甜圈了吗？
git show donut:you | grep "You ate.*donut"

[actions]

test "$(git rev-parse HEAD^)" = "$(git rev-parse donut)" && hint "如果想让蓝色分支 branch 标签跟着时间线前进，记得 checkout 到这个分支标签上。"
